cted-and-reborn-2022-02-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blade-reflected-and-reborn-2022-02-07#:~:text=He%20launched%20himself%20from,totality%20of%20his%20bulk.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Blade Reflected and Reborn\" by Emma Mieko Candon. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Feb 2022."}},{"id":"blade-reflected-and-reborn-2022-02-07-e7","era":null,"summary":"In a flashback, a boy poisons Chishiro's order at their haven and demands that Kaima bond with him.","participants":["tatsunari","chishiro","kaima","jukai-order"],"location":"jukai-forest","importance":"major","page":"stories/blade-reflected-and-reborn-2022-02-07","order":679,"story_date":"2022-02-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":97,"quote":"\"Well? You know what I want. Bond with me, and I'll have no need to kill him.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blade-reflected-and-reborn-2022-02-07#:~:text=%22Well%3F%20You%20know%20what,need%20to%20kill%20him.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Blade Reflected and Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Emma Mieko Candon"],"date":"2022-02-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blade-reflected-and-reborn-2022-02-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blade-reflected-and-reborn-2022-02-07#:~:text=%22Well%3F%20You%20know%20what,need%20to%20kill%20him.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Blade Reflected and Reborn\" by Emma Mieko Candon. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Feb 2022."}},{"id":"blade-reflected-and-reborn-2022-02-07-e8","era":null,"summary":"In the flashback, Chishiro lets Kaima go, the blade shatters, and Kaima tramples the boy and vanishes with the bond broken.","participants":["chishiro","kaima","tatsunari"],"location":"jukai-forest","importance":"major","page":"stories/blade-reflected-and-reborn-2022-02-07","order":679,"story_date":"2022-02-07","storyline":"",